    "%lld fps" : {
      "shouldTranslate" : false
    },
    "%lld min · first boot takes 5–15 min" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%lld 分钟 · 首次启动需要 5–15 分钟"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld of them use tricks the older loader could not handle; the native runtime handles those too, except for optional anti-tamper code, which it leaves out." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "其中 %lld 个使用了旧加载器无法处理的技巧；原生运行环境也能处理它们，只是会跳过可选的防篡改代码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld%%" : {
      "shouldTranslate" : false
    },
    "%llu frame(s) drawn · native runtime" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已绘制 %llu 帧 · 原生运行环境"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    ".apk, and split bundles as .apks, .xapk or .apkm. Share them to Husk, open them from Files, or tap + in the Library." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : ".apk，以及 .apks、.xapk 或 .apkm 格式的拆分安装包。可以分享到 Husk、从“文件”中打开，或在资源库中轻点 +。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 pixel per point. Fastest." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每点 1 像素。最快。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1. Make sure **LocalDevVPN** is installed and connected. The VPN icon should be in the status bar.\n2. Wi-Fi must be on, even though nothing leaves your iPhone.\n3. **Developer Mode** must be on (Settings › Privacy & Security › Developer Mode).\n4. The first time, Husk downloads Apple's Developer Disk Image, which can take a minute. Let it finish.\n5. Still failing? Toggle LocalDevVPN off and on, then pair again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. 确保已安装并连接 **LocalDevVPN**，状态栏中应显示 VPN 图标。\n2. 必须打开 Wi-Fi，即使数据不会离开你的 iPhone。\n3. 必须打开**开发者模式**（设置 › 隐私与安全性 › 开发者模式）。\n4. 第一次使用时，Husk 会下载 Apple 的开发者磁盘映像，可能需要一分钟，请等待完成。\n5. 仍然失败？关闭再打开 LocalDevVPN，然后重新配对。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1.5 pixels per point." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每点 1.5 像素。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1280" : {
      "shouldTranslate" : false
    },
    "2 pixels per point. The default." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每点 2 像素。默认设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "720" : {
      "shouldTranslate" : false
    },
    "A %@ game. It runs through Husk's native runtime, which loads its %lld arm64 libraries itself." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这是一个 %1$@ 游戏。它通过 Husk 的原生运行环境运行，运行环境会自己加载它的 %2$lld 个 arm64 库。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A Flutter app. Its engine and its compiled Dart run natively through Husk's translation layer, which loads its %lld arm64 libraries itself." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这是一个 Flutter App。它的引擎和编译后的 Dart 代码通过 Husk 的转译层以原生方式运行，转译层会自己加载它的 %lld 个 arm64 库。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A backup is a .zip of everything %@ has saved in Husk, to keep in Files or move to another device." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "备份是 %@ 在 Husk 中保存的所有内容的 .zip 文件，可以保存在“文件”中或转移到其他设备。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A console-style home: your games on a shelf, the one you pick fills the screen with its artwork, and Play is one tap away. Android and PS4 games side by side, a new library, in light or dark as Settings › Appearance says." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "主机风格的主页：你的游戏排列在架子上，选中的游戏会用封面铺满屏幕，轻点一下即可开始游戏。Android 和 PS4 游戏并排展示，全新的资源库，并按“设置 › 外观”显示浅色或深色。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A custom resolution sets the shape itself, so this does nothing while it is on. Type a wide size for landscape." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "自定分辨率本身决定屏幕形状，因此开启时此项无效。如需横屏，请输入较宽的尺寸。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A download failed" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有下载失败"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A few quick choices first. Everything here can be changed later in Settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "先做几个简单的选择。这里的所有设置以后都可以在“设置”中更改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A game" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一个游戏"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A game runs slowly or the phone gets hot" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "游戏运行缓慢或手机发热"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A jailbreak was found. Turn on Allow JIT in Apps." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "检测到越狱。请开启“Allow JIT in Apps”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A modded or repacked APK crashes" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "修改版或重新打包的 APK 会崩溃"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A new Android image is available" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有新的 Android 映像"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A new Husk" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "全新的 Husk"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A new look, PS4 games, and hundreds more Android games." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "全新外观、PS4 游戏，以及数百款新的 Android 游戏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A new pre-booted snapshot is available" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有新的预启动快照"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A pairing file made on a computer lets Husk talk to this %@ the same way." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在电脑上生成的配对文件可以让 Husk 以同样的方式与这台 %@ 通信。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A quick look at how Husk works: where your games are, how to add more, and where the settings live." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "快速了解 Husk 的使用方式：游戏在哪里、如何添加更多游戏，以及设置在哪里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A save file is too large to back up." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "某个存档文件太大，无法备份。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ANDROID" : {
      "shouldTranslate" : false
    },
    "APK installed" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "APK 已安装"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "APKs install from the Library's + button or from the Files tab. Split sets — a base APK plus its config pieces — must be picked together; installing the base alone fails on missing native libraries." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "APK 可通过资源库的 + 按钮或“文件”标签页安装。拆分安装包（一个基础 APK 加上若干配置包）必须一起选择；只安装基础 APK 会因缺少原生库而失败。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
