    "Add a Game or App" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "添加游戏或 App"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add a PS4 game with the + button, as a fake package (.pkg), a folder of them, or an extracted game folder, and play it from your library. Updates install beside their game, shaders are kept between launches, and games that ask for a name bring up the keyboard." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用 + 按钮添加 PS4 游戏，可以是 fake package（.pkg）、装有安装包的文件夹或解包后的游戏文件夹，然后从资源库开始游戏。更新会安装在对应游戏旁边，着色器在多次启动之间保留，需要输入名称的游戏会弹出键盘。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add a game with the + button." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用 + 按钮添加游戏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add a link to an APK or a file, or the address a computer gives you when it shares a folder." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "添加 APK 或文件的链接，或电脑共享文件夹时给出的地址。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add a source to start discovering apps." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "添加一个软件源，开始发现 App。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add an APK or a bundle from the menu, or share one to Husk." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "从菜单中添加 APK 或安装包，或将其分享到 Husk。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add to Husk" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "添加到 Husk"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add your first game" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "添加你的第一个游戏"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Added to the library" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已添加到资源库"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adding %@…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在添加 %@…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adding %lld APKs…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在添加 %lld 个 APK…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adding Games" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "添加游戏"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adds a sound device to the emulator. It can't be saved while this is on, so it boots from cold." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "为模拟器添加声音设备。开启时无法保存，因此会冷启动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adds a sound device. While it is attached Android cannot be saved — QEMU refuses to snapshot a machine with one — so every launch boots from cold. Turning it on or off costs a cold boot either way." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "添加一个声音设备。连接期间无法保存 Android（QEMU 拒绝为带声音设备的机器创建快照），因此每次启动都是冷启动。开启或关闭都需要一次冷启动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adds about 2 GB to the first download. It was captured on the software renderer, so it is not used on GPU — which cold-boots once and then saves its own." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "首次下载会增加约 2 GB。快照是在软件渲染器上制作的，因此 GPU 模式不使用它：GPU 模式会冷启动一次，然后保存自己的快照。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After playing, once per game per update" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "玩过之后询问，每个游戏每次更新问一次"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "全部"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All optional. You can change these any time in Settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "均为可选项，随时可以在“设置”中更改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Almost worth the wait" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "等待差不多值得了"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Always" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "始终"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Always this look." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "始终使用此外观。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An APK is added to your library when it finishes. Anything else goes into the Shared Storage folder, which games see as their phone storage." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "APK 下载完成后会添加到资源库。其他文件会放入“共享存储”文件夹，游戏会把它当作手机存储。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An Android app. Husk runs its code on its own Java runtime and loads its %lld arm64 libraries itself." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这是一个 Android App。Husk 在自己的 Java 运行环境中运行它的代码，并自己加载它的 %lld 个 arm64 库。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An Android app. Husk runs its code on its own Java runtime." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这是一个 Android App。Husk 在自己的 Java 运行环境中运行它的代码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An app will not open" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "App 打不开"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android" : {
      "shouldTranslate" : false
    },
    "Android App Info" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android 应用信息"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android Emulator" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android 模拟器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android Libraries Used" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用的 Android 库"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android Sound" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android 声音"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android and PS4 games, on your iPhone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 iPhone 上玩 Android 和 PS4 游戏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android and Translation Layer games need JIT. StikJIT, built into Husk, turns it on without a computer." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android 和转译层游戏都需要 JIT。Husk 内置的 StikJIT 无需电脑即可开启。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android and this app share the memory Husk runs translated code in, and together they do not fit. Close Husk and open it again, then start only the app (or only Android)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android 和此 App 共用 Husk 运行转译代码的内存，两者加起来放不下。请关闭并重新打开 Husk，然后只启动这个 App（或只启动 Android）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android apps and games are compiled while they run, which needs memory that can be written and then run. iOS only allows that while a debugger is attached to the app. Turning on JIT attaches one for a moment. Without it, Husk can show your library but cannot start Android or a game." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android App 和游戏在运行时会编译代码，这需要可以先写入再执行的内存。iOS 只在 App 连接了调试器时才允许这样做。开启 JIT 就是短暂地连接一个调试器。没有它，Husk 可以显示你的资源库，但无法启动 Android 或游戏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android can't start without JIT" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "没有 JIT，Android 无法启动"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android cannot reshape a screen once it is running, so a landscape game on a portrait screen gets letterboxed into a band and looks tiny. Creating it landscape is the only way it can fill it — portrait apps are letterboxed instead. Costs one cold boot." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android 运行后无法改变屏幕形状，所以横屏游戏在竖屏上会被加上黑边、缩成一条，看起来很小。只有以横屏创建屏幕，游戏才能铺满；竖屏 App 则会加上黑边。需要一次冷启动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android draws on the real GPU through Metal — about four times the frame rate. This is the default." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android 通过 Metal 在真实 GPU 上绘制，帧率约为 CPU 的四倍。这是默认设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android init, first stage" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android init，第一阶段"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android init, second stage" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android init，第二阶段"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android installs it from where it already is — nothing is copied." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android 会直接从原位置安装，不会拷贝任何内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android is booting…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android 正在启动…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android is locked. Open the Android screen, unlock it, and try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android 已锁定。请打开 Android 屏幕，解锁后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android is locked. Unlock it and try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android 已锁定。请解锁后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android is not downloaded." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android 尚未下载。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android is ready" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android 已就绪"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android is up" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android 已启动"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android needs memory it can write and then run, which on iOS only an attached debugger can grant. Choose how your %@ gets one." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android 需要先写入再执行的内存，在 iOS 上只有连接的调试器才能授予。请选择你的 %@ 获取调试器的方式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android no longer crashes after its download, the full Android emulator moved into Settings with a warning, closing Husk from the app switcher isn't reported as a crash, and much more." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android 下载后不再崩溃；完整的 Android 模拟器移到了“设置”中并附有警告；从 App 切换器关闭 Husk 不再被报告为崩溃；还有更多改进。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android reaches the internet through a virtual ethernet card on QEMU's own network. Nothing on your phone's network can see the guest, and the guest cannot see it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android 通过 QEMU 自己网络上的虚拟以太网卡连接互联网。手机所在网络中的设备看不到客户机，客户机也看不到它们。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android runs fully emulated, so it is slower than games on the translation layer. Use it for apps Husk cannot run directly, like Termux or app stores." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android 完全通过模拟运行，因此比转译层上的游戏慢。适合 Husk 无法直接运行的 App，例如 Termux 或应用商店。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android runtime" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android 运行环境"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android takes a long time to start" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android 启动很慢"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android update ready" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android 更新已就绪"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android will boot from cold once, then save a new one." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android 会冷启动一次，然后保存新的机器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android will get" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android 将获得"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android · Emulator" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android · 模拟器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android's native code expects things of the processor and of memory that only the phone can answer -- above all, whether a library's code can run with its data writable right beside it. Enable JIT first, or the memory checks are skipped. The results go to the console too." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android 的原生代码对处理器和内存有一些只有手机本身才能回答的要求，最重要的是：库的代码能否在旁边就是可写数据的情况下运行。请先开启 JIT，否则会跳过内存检查。结果也会输出到控制台。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android's system, its data and the saved machine take %@. Apps and games on the translation layer do not need them. Android downloads again the next time it is started." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Android 系统、其数据和已保存的机器共占用 %@。转译层上的 App 和游戏不需要它们。下次启动 Android 时会重新下载。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Anonymous" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "匿名"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Another game" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "另一个游戏"
