    "Downloads" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "下载"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag a control to move it, or tap one to resize or hide it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "拖动控件可以移动它，轻点控件可以调整大小或隐藏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each app is played once JIT is on, watched for 15 seconds, and written down; then Husk closes. Open Husk again for the next one. At the end the results file is offered to share." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "JIT 开启后，每个 App 会运行一次，观察 15 秒并记录结果，然后 Husk 会关闭。重新打开 Husk 进行下一个。全部完成后会提供结果文件供分享。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each app keeps its data inside Husk. On an app's page, **Back Up Saves** exports them and **Restore Saves** brings them back, including onto another iPhone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个 App 的数据都保存在 Husk 内部。在 App 页面中，**备份存档**可以将其导出，**恢复存档**可以将其恢复，也可以恢复到另一台 iPhone 上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each time Husk opens without JIT, it asks TrollStore to turn it on. TrollStore's URL Scheme setting must be on." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每次 Husk 在没有 JIT 的情况下打开时，都会请求 TrollStore 开启 JIT。必须打开 TrollStore 的“URL Scheme”设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each time Husk opens without JIT, it asks the built-in StikJIT to turn it on, so games are ready without a tap. Needs StikJIT set up once (paired) first." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每次 Husk 在没有 JIT 的情况下打开时，都会请求内置 StikJIT 开启 JIT，游戏无需点按即可就绪。需要先设置（配对）一次 StikJIT。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
