    },
    "Full Android emulation is experimental. It is slow, takes minutes to start, and can freeze or crash Husk. Games and apps run much better in the Translation Layer." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "完整 Android 模拟仍是实验性功能。它很慢，需要几分钟才能启动，还可能让 Husk 卡死或崩溃。游戏和 App 在转译层中运行效果好得多。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Full Android runs in an emulator, for the apps the Translation Layer can't run yet. It is experimental: slow, and it can freeze or crash." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "完整的 Android 在模拟器中运行，用于转译层暂时无法运行的 App。此功能为实验性：速度慢，可能卡死或崩溃。"
          }
        }
