    "Games need JIT, which iOS only grants to an attached debugger. StikJIT is built into Husk and turns it on from inside the app, with no computer. StikDebug and TrollStore work too." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "游戏需要 JIT，而 iOS 只会把它授予连接的调试器。Husk 内置了 StikJIT，可以在 App 内直接开启 JIT，无需电脑。StikDebug 和 TrollStore 也可以使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Games need JIT. Turn it on from Home or Settings › JIT & Sideload. Settings also has performance, appearance, input, and the optional full Android emulator." : {
