    },
    "Husk closed while the game was running" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "游戏运行时 Husk 关闭了"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk could not announce itself on the local network. Check that Wi-Fi is on, then try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Husk 无法在本地网络上广播自己。请确认 Wi-Fi 已打开，然后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk could not copy it: %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Husk 无法复制它：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk could not get executable memory. Turn JIT on again (Settings > JIT) and retry." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Husk 无法获取可执行内存。请重新开启 JIT（设置 > JIT）后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk could not open its pairing port." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Husk 无法打开配对端口。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk couldn't reach this device. Connect LocalDevVPN, then try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Husk 无法连接此设备。请连接 LocalDevVPN 后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk has no Google Play services, so “Sign in with Google” buttons can fail. Use email or another sign-in if the app offers one." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Husk 没有 Google Play 服务，因此“使用 Google 登录”按钮可能会失败。如果 App 提供电子邮件或其他登录方式，请改用它们。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk is using a lot of storage" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Husk 占用了很多存储空间"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk needs Local Network access to pair. Allow it in Settings › Apps › Husk, then try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Husk 需要访问本地网络才能配对。请在“设置 › App › Husk”中允许，然后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk needs memory it can write and then execute, which on iOS takes an attached debugger. There are two ways to get it: a debugger that services trap requests, or a MAP_JIT mapping, which the kernel allows any debugged process. Either one is enough — which is available depends on the device and the iOS version, so Husk tests both rather than assuming." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Husk 需要先写入再执行的内存，在 iOS 上这需要连接调试器。有两种方式：由调试器处理陷阱请求，或使用 MAP_JIT 映射（内核允许任何被调试的进程使用）。任一方式都足够；哪种可用取决于设备和 iOS 版本，所以 Husk 会两种都测试，而不是预设。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk now runs on iOS 15.5 and later (PS4 games need iOS 17.4)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Husk 现在可以在 iOS 15.5 及更高版本上运行（PS4 游戏需要 iOS 17.4）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk pairing code: %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Husk 配对代码：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk pretends to be a computer on your Wi-Fi, and your %@ pairs with it the way it would with a Mac." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Husk 会在你的 Wi-Fi 上伪装成一台电脑，你的 %@ 会像与 Mac 配对一样与它配对。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk restores a saved machine instead of booting it, which takes seconds rather than minutes. The picture freezes while it writes. With this off, nothing saves by itself — including after an install." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Husk 会恢复已保存的机器，而不是重新启动，只需几秒而不是几分钟。写入时画面会冻结。关闭此项后不会自动保存，包括安装 App 之后。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk runs unmodified Android APKs in a real Android system on your iPhone. The console shows Husk's live log, the guest's serial output and QEMU's own output — the three files any problem here is diagnosed from." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Husk 在你的 iPhone 上的真实 Android 系统中运行未经修改的 Android APK。控制台会显示 Husk 的实时日志、客户机的串口输出和 QEMU 自己的输出，这三个文件是诊断问题的依据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk tells you when a new version is out. Install the new IPA over the old one with the same sideloader. Your library, apps and saves are kept." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有新版本时 Husk 会通知你。用同一个侧载工具将新的 IPA 覆盖安装到旧版本上。你的资源库、App 和存档都会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk turns the screen the way the game asks for." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Husk 会按游戏的要求旋转屏幕。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk was marked as debugged when it opened, so JIT is on." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Husk 打开时已被标记为被调试，因此 JIT 已开启。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk will not open at all" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Husk 完全打不开"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk will use StikDebug." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Husk 将使用 StikDebug。"
