    "Nothing is saved, so Android boots from cold." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "没有保存的机器，Android 将冷启动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing matches “%@”. Open Settings › About › Open Console to see what Husk is doing." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "没有与“%@”匹配的内容。打开“设置 › 关于 › 打开控制台”查看 Husk 正在做什么。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing was recorded, which usually means iOS ended Husk for using too much memory, or Husk was closed from the app switcher." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "没有记录到任何信息，这通常意味着 iOS 因内存占用过多而结束了 Husk，或者 Husk 是从 App 切换器中关闭的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing yet" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "暂无"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Noto Sans CJK, the font Android uses for these languages. Games and apps that draw their own text (Unity, Flutter, cocos2d-x) show empty boxes for these characters without it. Takes effect the next time an app opens." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Noto Sans CJK 是 Android 用于这些语言的字体。自己绘制文字的游戏和 App（Unity、Flutter、cocos2d-x）在没有它时会把这些字符显示为空白方框。下次打开 App 时生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Now" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当前"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OK" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "好"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off by default. Husk detaches StikDebug as soon as the JIT region is held, because a debugger that iOS has suspended stops the whole app the next time it is needed. Turn this on only to collect StikDebug's own logs." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "默认关闭。Husk 在拿到 JIT 内存区域后会立即断开 StikDebug，因为被 iOS 挂起的调试器会在下次需要时让整个 App 停住。仅在需要收集 StikDebug 自身日志时开启。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off by default. The full Android emulator is experimental: starting it on launch can cause unwanted bugs, freezes and crashes, and slows every launch. Games and apps don't need it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "默认关闭。完整的 Android 模拟器仍是实验性功能：启动时运行可能导致意外的错误、卡死和崩溃，还会拖慢每次启动。游戏和 App 都不需要它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On a computer, make this %@'s pairing file with the [StikDebug pairing-file guide](https://github.com/StikDebug/StikDebug-Guide/blob/main/pairing_file.md)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在电脑上，按照 [StikDebug 配对文件指南](https://github.com/StikDebug/StikDebug-Guide/blob/main/pairing_file.md) 生成这台 %@ 的配对文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On a device jailbroken with Dopamine, JIT is a setting: the jailbreak marks every app as debugged when it opens, and a debugged app may run code it wrote. Husk needs nothing else." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在使用 Dopamine 越狱的设备上，JIT 只是一个设置：越狱会在每个 App 打开时将其标记为被调试，被调试的 App 可以运行自己写入的代码。Husk 不需要其他任何东西。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On a jailbroken device JIT is a setting. In Dopamine, turn on Allow JIT in Apps, then open Husk again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在越狱设备上，JIT 只是一个设置。请在 Dopamine 中开启“Allow JIT in Apps”，然后重新打开 Husk。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On-screen controller" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "屏幕手柄"
          }
        }
      }
    },
