    "Open Settings" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打开“设置”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open StikDebug on its own and check that it has your pairing file and that LocalDevVPN is connected. Update StikDebug to the latest release. Husk sends StikDebug its script itself, so nothing needs setting up for Husk inside StikDebug." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "单独打开 StikDebug，检查它是否有你的配对文件、LocalDevVPN 是否已连接。将 StikDebug 更新到最新版本。Husk 会自己把脚本发给 StikDebug，因此无需在 StikDebug 中为 Husk 做任何设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open in Files" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在“文件”中打开"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open its page in the Library. Husk says why it stopped:\n• **Protected app:** it checks that it is on a real Android phone, or uses anti-cheat or DRM. Husk does not get around these.\n• **Wrong kind of CPU code:** the APK only has 32-bit code. Find an arm64 (arm64-v8a) version.\n• **Incomplete app or missing game data:** the APK needs its split files or an OBB. Import the full .apks, .xapk or .apkm.\n• **Needs Google:** the app requires a Google account or Play services Husk cannot provide.\n• **Uses something Husk does not have yet:** share the report so it can be added." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在资源库中打开它的页面，Husk 会说明它停止的原因：\n• **受保护的 App**：它会检查是否运行在真正的 Android 手机上，或使用了反作弊或 DRM。Husk 不会绕过这些保护。\n• **CPU 代码类型不对**：此 APK 只有 32 位代码。请寻找 arm64（arm64-v8a）版本。\n• **App 不完整或缺少游戏数据**：此 APK 需要其拆分文件或 OBB。请导入完整的 .apks、.xapk 或 .apkm。\n• **需要 Google**：此 App 需要 Google 账户或 Husk 无法提供的 Play 服务。\n• **使用了 Husk 尚不支持的功能**：请分享报告，以便添加支持。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open on antiweb.lol" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 antiweb.lol 上打开"
          }
        }
      }
