          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open the app's page in your Library and tap **Share Report**. For Husk's own log, go to Settings › About › **Open Console**. Turning on **Developer Info** there adds more detail." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在资源库中打开该 App 的页面，轻点**分享报告**。Husk 自己的日志请前往“设置 › 关于 › **打开控制台**”。在那里开启**开发者信息**可以获得更多细节。"
          }
        }
      }
