    "Pairing files stop working when the iPhone's trust settings are reset, and sometimes after an iOS update. Make a new one, or pair on the iPhone itself if you are on iOS 27, then import it again in Settings › JIT." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
