    "StikDebug" : {
      "shouldTranslate" : false
    },
    "StikDebug is a separate app that attaches to Husk. Husk sends it the JIT script itself, so nothing needs configuring for Husk inside StikDebug." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "StikDebug 是一个会连接到 Husk 的独立 App。Husk 会自己把 JIT 脚本发送给它，因此无需在 StikDebug 中为 Husk 做任何配置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "StikDebug is installed, so Husk will open it to turn JIT on." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已安装 StikDebug，Husk 会打开它来开启 JIT。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "StikDebug is installed, so Husk will open it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已安装 StikDebug，Husk 会打开它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "StikDebug is installed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已安装 StikDebug。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "StikDebug is not installed. Install it, or set up Built-in StikJIT." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "未安装 StikDebug。请安装它，或设置内置 StikJIT。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "StikDebug opens but JIT stays off" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "StikDebug 打开了，但 JIT 仍未开启"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "StikDebug, TrollStore and a jailbreak were not found, so Husk will use its built-in helper." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "未找到 StikDebug、TrollStore 或越狱，Husk 将使用内置的辅助程序。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "StikJIT is built in — the recommended way" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已内置 StikJIT，推荐使用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "StikJIT is built into Husk. You can turn JIT on right here — no computer and no other app. Games and Android both need it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "StikJIT 已内置于 Husk。你可以直接在这里开启 JIT，无需电脑或其他 App。游戏和 Android 都需要它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "StikJIT says it cannot connect, or Enable JIT fails" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "StikJIT 提示无法连接，或开启 JIT 失败"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stop" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "停止"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stop Download" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "停止下载"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stopped: %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已停止：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Storage" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "存储空间"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Store" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "商店"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stuck? Settings › Help answers the common problems, and a game that crashes Husk leaves a report to share." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "遇到问题？“设置 › 帮助”解答了常见问题，导致 Husk 崩溃的游戏会留下可以分享的报告。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "系统"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System follows the phone: light by day, dark by night. The guest's own screen stays dark either way — it is a picture of another phone. Holiday decorations appear from December to early January." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“系统”跟随手机：白天浅色，夜间深色。客户机自己的屏幕始终为深色，因为它是另一部手机的画面。节日装饰会在 12 月到次年 1 月初出现。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tablet — 1280 × 800" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "平板 — 1280 × 800"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap **Check setup**. Husk checks LocalDevVPN and prepares the Developer Disk Image." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "轻点**检查设置**。Husk 会检查 LocalDevVPN 并准备开发者磁盘映像。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap **Choose pairing file** and pick it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "轻点**选择配对文件**并选中它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap **Connect LocalDevVPN**. It switches the VPN on and comes straight back to Husk." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "轻点**连接 LocalDevVPN**。它会打开 VPN 并立即返回 Husk。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap **Enable JIT**. Husk's helper attaches and Android can start." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "轻点**开启 JIT**。Husk 的辅助程序会连接，Android 即可启动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap **Start pairing** in Husk first and allow **Local Network** access when asked. If you said no earlier, turn it on in Settings › Privacy & Security › Local Network › Husk. Wi-Fi has to be on. Developer Mode must already be enabled, which restarts the iPhone the first time." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请先在 Husk 中轻点**开始配对**，并在询问时允许访问**本地网络**。如果之前拒绝了，请在“设置 › 隐私与安全性 › 本地网络 › Husk”中开启。必须打开 Wi-Fi。开发者模式必须已启用，首次启用会重启 iPhone。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap + and pick a fake package (.pkg), a folder of packages, or an extracted game folder (eboot.bin and sce_sys). Husk installs it into PS4 Games in Files, and an update package goes beside the game it updates. Retail packages are locked to a PS4 and do not install. PS4 games need iOS 17.4 or later." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "轻点 +，选择一个 fake package（.pkg）、一个装有多个安装包的文件夹，或一个解包后的游戏文件夹（包含 eboot.bin 和 sce_sys）。Husk 会将其安装到“文件”中的 PS4 Games，更新包会放在对应游戏旁边。零售版安装包绑定 PS4 主机，无法安装。PS4 游戏需要 iOS 17.4 或更高版本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap + to add an Android APK or bundle (.xapk, .apkm, .apks), or a PS4 game: a fake package (.pkg), a folder of them, or an extracted game folder. You can also share files to Husk from Files or Safari." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "轻点 + 添加 Android APK 或安装包（.xapk、.apkm、.apks），或 PS4 游戏：fake package（.pkg）、装有安装包的文件夹，或解包后的游戏文件夹。也可以从“文件”或 Safari 浏览器将文件分享到 Husk。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap with three fingers to show the interface" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "三指轻点以显示界面"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Teaching an iPhone to speak Android" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在教 iPhone 说 Android"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Teal" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "蓝绿色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Technical Details" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "技术细节"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Technical detail in the Android Translation Layer screens: library reports, device checks and run logs." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 Android 转译层页面中显示技术细节：库报告、设备检查和运行日志。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tested by the Husk team on an iPhone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "由 Husk 团队在 iPhone 上测试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text fields in Unity, Java, Flutter, cocos2d-x and SDL games bring up the keyboard." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Unity、Java、Flutter、cocos2d-x 和 SDL 游戏中的文本框会弹出键盘。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thanks!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "谢谢！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That backup has no saves in it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该备份中没有存档。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That backup is damaged." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该备份已损坏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That backup is of %@, not %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该备份属于 %1$@，而不是 %2$@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That backup was recompressed by another app; Husk reads only the backups it makes." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该备份被其他 App 重新压缩过；Husk 只能读取自己生成的备份。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That bundle uses a zip format (Zip64) Husk does not read yet." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该安装包使用了 Husk 尚不支持的 zip 格式（Zip64）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That file is not a Husk save backup." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该文件不是 Husk 的存档备份。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That file is not a bundle Husk can read." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该文件不是 Husk 能读取的安装包。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That file is not a zip." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该文件不是 zip 文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That folder is empty." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该文件夹是空的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That is not a remote pairing file. Make one with the StikDebug pairing-file guide and try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这不是远程配对文件。请按照 StikDebug 配对文件指南生成一个，然后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That is not a web address." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这不是网址。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The DeveloperTesting folder is empty." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "DeveloperTesting 文件夹是空的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The anonymous login service (Aurora's token dispenser) is not working right now" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "匿名登录服务（Aurora 的令牌分发器）目前无法使用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app called %@, a system function Husk does not provide yet." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此 App 调用了 %@，这是 Husk 尚未提供的系统函数。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app crashed" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "App 崩溃了"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app needs a part of Android that Husk's runtime does not provide yet: %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此 App 需要 Husk 运行环境尚未提供的 Android 组件：%@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app refused to run here" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "App 拒绝在此运行"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app's own native code (%@) stopped with %@. It most likely needs something from Android that Husk does not provide yet, or does something iOS does not allow." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "App 自己的原生代码（%1$@）因 %2$@ 而停止。它很可能需要 Husk 尚未提供的 Android 功能，或者做了 iOS 不允许的事情。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app's video is DRM-protected (Widevine), which only certified Android devices can decrypt. Unprotected video plays; protected video stays black." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此 App 的视频受 DRM（Widevine）保护，只有经过认证的 Android 设备才能解密。未受保护的视频可以播放；受保护的视频会保持黑屏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The compatibility list could not be reached." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法连接兼容性列表。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The debugger is attached but is not answering trap requests, and this device will not execute a MAP_JIT mapping either, so no executable memory could be claimed. This is what happens when Husk runs inside another container app rather than sideloaded on its own." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "调试器已连接，但没有响应陷阱请求，而且此设备也不能执行 MAP_JIT 映射，因此无法获取可执行内存。Husk 在其他容器 App 中运行，而不是单独侧载时，就会出现这种情况。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The download failed: %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "下载失败：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The downloaded image did not match the release. Tap to retry." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "下载的映像与发布版本不符。轻点以重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The end of the log from the last time the game started. Share it when reporting a problem." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "上次启动游戏时日志的末尾部分。报告问题时请分享它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The first check downloads and mounts Apple's Developer Disk Image, which can take a minute." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "首次检查会下载并装载 Apple 的开发者磁盘映像，可能需要一分钟。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The first launch of a big game prepares its code and data, and can take up to a minute. If it is still black after that, close it, open it once more and share the report if nothing changes." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "大型游戏首次启动时会准备代码和数据，最长可能需要一分钟。如果之后仍然黑屏，请关闭它再打开一次；如果没有变化，请分享报告。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The first start downloads the Android image and boots it from cold, which takes a few minutes. After that Husk restores a saved machine, which is much faster." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "第一次启动会下载 Android 映像并冷启动，需要几分钟。之后 Husk 会恢复已保存的机器，速度快得多。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game and everything it saved here are deleted from Husk." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "游戏及其在这里保存的所有内容都会从 Husk 中删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game could not start" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "游戏无法启动"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game could not start. Its log is in the game's Technical Details." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "游戏无法启动。它的日志在游戏的“技术细节”中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game crashed" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "游戏崩溃了"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game exited" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "游戏已退出"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game has ended." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "游戏已结束。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game is loaded in this session. Close Husk completely and open it again to reset its data." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "游戏已在本次运行中加载。请完全关闭 Husk 并重新打开以重置其数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game starts with nothing over it: no bar, no controller, no readout. Tap with three fingers at once to bring the bar back, and again to hide it. The Hide button in the bar does the same while playing." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "游戏启动时上方不显示任何东西：没有工具栏、手柄或读数。三指同时轻点可以调出工具栏，再次轻点则隐藏。游戏中工具栏上的“隐藏”按钮效果相同。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game stopped" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "游戏已停止"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The helper did not attach within 90 seconds. Check that LocalDevVPN is connected, then try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "辅助程序在 90 秒内没有连接。请确认 LocalDevVPN 已连接，然后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The language apps and games inside Husk see. Husk's own language is in Settings › General › Language." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Husk 中的 App 和游戏看到的语言。Husk 本身的语言在“设置 › 通用 › 语言”中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The list is written to disk, so it is on screen before Android has finished starting." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "列表会写入磁盘，因此在 Android 启动完成之前就能显示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The pairing file stays in Husk's Documents folder and is only sent to Husk's own helper." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "配对文件保存在 Husk 的“文稿”文件夹中，只会发送给 Husk 自己的辅助程序。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The panel is built when the machine starts, so a change costs one cold boot, and the next save replaces the machine saved at the old size — changing back costs another. Sizes are rounded to a multiple of eight. Bigger is slower: every pixel is drawn by an emulated phone. Android's density does not change with the panel, so a larger one shows more rather than bigger." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "屏幕在机器启动时创建，因此更改需要一次冷启动，下一次保存会替换按旧尺寸保存的机器，改回去还需要再冷启动一次。尺寸会取整到 8 的倍数。越大越慢：每个像素都由模拟的手机绘制。Android 的像素密度不随屏幕改变，所以更大的屏幕显示更多内容，而不是更大的内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The plan, in order, is docs/04-translation-layer.md in Husk's source." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "计划按顺序记录在 Husk 源代码的 docs/04-translation-layer.md 中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The report holds the full log of that run and which device and build it was on. Nothing is sent anywhere unless you share it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "报告包含那次运行的完整日志以及所用的设备和构建版本。除非你分享，否则不会发送到任何地方。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The request for Husk's JIT helper could not be encoded." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法编码发给 Husk 的 JIT 辅助程序的请求。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The runtime could not start it. The report says which part was missing." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "运行环境无法启动它。报告中说明了缺少哪个部分。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The runtime on disk is not a valid image (%@). Tap to retry." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "磁盘上的运行环境不是有效的映像（%@）。轻点以重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The screen stays black" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "屏幕一直是黑的"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "服务器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The snapshot did not match the release (sha256 %@, expected %@)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "快照与发布版本不符（sha256 %1$@，应为 %2$@）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Theme" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "主题"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There are no APKs in that bundle." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该安装包中没有 APK。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There is no screen to show the file picker on." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "没有可以显示文件选择器的屏幕。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They go to %@. Unmodified APKs install from here too." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它们会存放到 %@。未修改的 APK 也可以从这里安装。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This APK has no 64-bit code Husk can run, so it will probably not start." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此 APK 没有 Husk 可以运行的 64 位代码，因此很可能无法启动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This app carries anti-tamper protection (%@). Such protection checks that it runs on a certified Android phone and closes the app otherwise, so it may not start in Husk." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此 App 带有防篡改保护（%@）。这种保护会检查它是否运行在经过认证的 Android 手机上，否则就关闭 App，因此它可能无法在 Husk 中启动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This app does its main work in Linux programs it starts as processes of their own (here %@). Its own screens run in Husk, but iOS does not let an app start other processes, so those programs, and the games or tools they run, can not start yet." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此 App 的主要工作由它以独立进程启动的 Linux 程序完成（这里是 %@）。它自己的界面可以在 Husk 中运行，但 iOS 不允许 App 启动其他进程，所以这些程序以及它们运行的游戏或工具暂时无法启动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This app is published in several pieces (split APKs) and only its base was imported, so its libraries or resources are missing. Import the whole bundle (.apks, .xapk or .apkm), or get it from Husk's store." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此 App 被拆分为多个部分（拆分 APK）发布，而只导入了基础部分，因此缺少它的库或资源。请导入完整的安装包（.apks、.xapk 或 .apkm），或从 Husk 的商店获取。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This app only works signed in to a Google account. It asked Android to pick one, and Husk has no Google accounts to offer, so the app closed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此 App 只能在登录 Google 账户后使用。它请求 Android 选择一个账户，而 Husk 没有 Google 账户可以提供，所以 App 关闭了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This app relies on Google Play services (Google sign-in, Google's account and device checks) for more than Husk can answer for. Apps that only use Google's libraries run; this one stops without the real services." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此 App 依赖 Google Play 服务（Google 登录、Google 的账户和设备检查），超出了 Husk 能应对的范围。只使用 Google 库的 App 可以运行；这个 App 没有真正的服务就会停止。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This build of Husk does not include the PS4 layer." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此版本的 Husk 不包含 PS4 层。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This copy of Husk doesn't have the PS4 layer." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此版本的 Husk 不包含 PS4 层。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This device closed the connection, which usually means it no longer accepts Husk's pairing. Pair again, and check that LocalDevVPN is connected." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此设备关闭了连接，这通常意味着它不再接受 Husk 的配对。请重新配对，并确认 LocalDevVPN 已连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This device is jailbroken, so JIT comes from the jailbreak's Allow JIT in Apps setting." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此设备已越狱，JIT 来自越狱的“Allow JIT in Apps”设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This file is not an app Husk can read." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Husk 无法读取此文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This file is not an app Husk can read: %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Husk 无法读取此文件：%@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This game keeps most of its data in an expansion file (OBB) that the Play Store downloads separately from the app. Husk installed the app itself but not that file, so the game cannot load." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此游戏的大部分数据保存在扩展文件（OBB）中，由 Play 商店与 App 分开下载。Husk 只安装了 App 本身，没有那个文件，因此游戏无法加载。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This iPhone" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这台 iPhone"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This iPhone only lets an app run translated code while a debugger enables JIT for it. Open Husk through StikDebug, or tap Turn On JIT in Husk, then start the app again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这台 iPhone 只允许在调试器为 App 开启 JIT 时运行转译后的代码。请通过 StikDebug 打开 Husk，或在 Husk 中轻点“开启 JIT”，然后重新启动 App。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This installation can only wait about 30 seconds in the background, so go to Settings straight away." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此安装在后台只能等待约 30 秒，请立即前往“设置”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is Geode's Android launcher. On Husk, Geode runs inside Geometry Dash instead: turn it on here (or in Geometry Dash's settings, under Mods), then start Geometry Dash and use Geode's button on its main menu to get mods. This APK supplies a library Geode needs, so keep it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这是 Geode 的 Android 启动器。在 Husk 上，Geode 运行在 Geometry Dash 内部：在这里（或在 Geometry Dash 设置的“Mods”中）开启它，然后启动 Geometry Dash，用主菜单上的 Geode 按钮获取模组。此 APK 提供 Geode 需要的一个库，请保留它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is a whole operating system — be patient" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这是一整个操作系统，请耐心等待"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This needs %@ more and the device has %@ free." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "还需要 %1$@ 空间，而设备只有 %2$@ 可用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This was removed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此项已被移除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Time Zone" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "时区"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tinted Dark" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "着色深色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tinted Light" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "着色浅色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tints buttons, switches and selected states throughout the app." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "为整个 App 中的按钮、开关和选中状态着色。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Title ID" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "游戏 ID"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To send a whole folder from a computer on the same Wi‑Fi, run this on it and enter the address it shows:" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "要从同一 Wi‑Fi 下的电脑发送整个文件夹，请在电脑上运行以下命令，然后输入它显示的地址："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Touch" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "触控"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Touch always works. A gamepad and a pointer are not wired through to Android yet." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "触控始终可用。手柄和指针暂未接入 Android。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Touch is always on. The keyboard and the rotate control are in the pill at the bottom of the guest's screen; a gamepad and a pointer are not wired through yet." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "触控始终开启。键盘和旋转控制位于客户机屏幕底部的胶囊按钮中；手柄和指针暂未接入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Translating arm64, one block at a time" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在转译 arm64，一次一个代码块"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Translation Layer" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "转译层"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Trap servicer" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "陷阱服务"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TrollStore" : {
      "shouldTranslate" : false
    },
    "TrollStore can enable JIT for apps it installed, with no pairing file, VPN or computer." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "TrollStore 可以为它安装的 App 开启 JIT，无需配对文件、VPN 或电脑。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TrollStore can turn JIT on for Husk: it opens Husk and enables it, with no computer. In TrollStore's Settings, URL Scheme must be on." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "TrollStore 可以为 Husk 开启 JIT：它会打开 Husk 并启用 JIT，无需电脑。必须打开 TrollStore 设置中的“URL Scheme”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TrollStore could not be opened. Install Husk through TrollStore, or choose another method." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法打开 TrollStore。请通过 TrollStore 安装 Husk，或选择其他方式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TrollStore did not enable JIT. In TrollStore's Settings turn on URL Scheme, and make sure Husk was installed through TrollStore (or is signed with get-task-allow)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "TrollStore 没有开启 JIT。请在 TrollStore 的设置中开启“URL Scheme”，并确认 Husk 是通过 TrollStore 安装的（或使用 get-task-allow 签名）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TrollStore installs turn JIT on at launch, and Husk says on screen when something can't start without it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "通过 TrollStore 安装时会在启动时开启 JIT；某些内容缺少 JIT 无法启动时，Husk 会在屏幕上说明。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TrollStore is installed, so Husk will ask it to enable JIT." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已安装 TrollStore，Husk 会请求它开启 JIT。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TrollStore is installed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已安装 TrollStore。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TrollStore was not found on this %@. It installs on iOS 14.0 to 17.0." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在这台 %@ 上未找到 TrollStore。它可以安装在 iOS 14.0 到 17.0 上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try Again" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "重试"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try to Run" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "尝试运行"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn On" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
