    "Welcome to Husk" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "欢迎使用 Husk"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What %@ has saved now is replaced by the backup. Back up first if you want to keep it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 现在的存档会被备份替换。如需保留，请先备份。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What is JIT, and why does Husk need it?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "什么是 JIT？Husk 为什么需要它？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What is the difference between apps and Android?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "App 和 Android 有什么区别？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What the game is called in Husk. The game itself is not changed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "游戏在 Husk 中显示的名称。游戏本身不会被修改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What worked, what didn’t, how far you got" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "哪些能用、哪些不行、你玩到了哪里"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What's New in Husk %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Husk %@ 的新功能"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When Husk opens again it shows what happened, with a report you can share. Usually the game ran out of memory or hit something Husk does not support yet. Close other apps, and share the report if it keeps happening." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "再次打开 Husk 时会显示发生了什么，并提供可以分享的报告。通常是游戏内存不足，或遇到了 Husk 尚不支持的功能。请关闭其他 App；如果反复出现，请分享报告。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When a new Android image or snapshot is published, Husk asks once whether to download it. Never asked before Android has been downloaded." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当发布新的 Android 映像或快照时，Husk 会询问一次是否下载。下载 Android 之前不会询问。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whenever Android or a game starts, Husk asks TrollStore to enable JIT. TrollStore opens Husk, attaches to it for a moment and lets go, which leaves it allowed to run code it wrote." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每次 Android 或游戏启动时，Husk 都会请求 TrollStore 开启 JIT。TrollStore 会打开 Husk，短暂连接后再断开，这样 Husk 就可以运行自己写入的代码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whenever Android starts, Husk opens StikDebug, which attaches and comes back." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每次 Android 启动时，Husk 会打开 StikDebug，它连接后会返回。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where are my saves?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "我的存档在哪里？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
