    "Yes. Connect it to your iPhone in Bluetooth settings, and games that support controllers see it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "可以。在蓝牙设置中将手柄连接到 iPhone，支持手柄的游戏就能识别到它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can browse and import apps, but nothing Android can run. Every game and app needs JIT." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "可以浏览和导入 App，但无法运行任何 Android 内容。所有游戏和 App 都需要 JIT。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can skip this: Husk asks again when a game needs it, and it is in Settings › JIT & Sideload." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "可以跳过：游戏需要时 Husk 会再次询问，也可以在“设置 › JIT 与侧载”中找到。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You have %@. The new version's IPA is on its release page." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你当前的版本是 %@。新版本的 IPA 在其发布页面上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Husk log helps the developer see what went wrong. Only moderators can read it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的 Husk 日志能帮助开发者了解出了什么问题。只有管理员可以查看。"
