    },
    "• **Opens and closes instantly:** the signing certificate has probably expired. Free Apple accounts last 7 days. Re-sign or reinstall Husk with your sideloader; your apps and saves stay.\n• **“Untrusted Developer”:** go to Settings › General › VPN & Device Management and trust your certificate.\n• **Asks for Developer Mode:** turn it on in Settings › Privacy & Security." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• **打开后立即关闭**：签名证书可能已过期。免费 Apple 账户的证书有效期为 7 天。请用侧载工具重新签名或重新安装 Husk；你的 App 和存档会保留。\n• **“未受信任的开发者”**：前往“设置 › 通用 › VPN 与设备管理”并信任你的证书。\n• **要求开启开发者模式**：在“设置 › 隐私与安全性”中开启。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• **iOS 27 or later:** Settings › JIT › Pair on this iPhone. No computer needed.\n• **iOS 26:** StikJIT (built in) with a pairing file made on a computer, plus LocalDevVPN.\n• **Older iOS, or Husk inside LiveContainer:** the StikDebug app.\n• **Installed with TrollStore:** TrollStore, with its URL Scheme setting on.\n• **Jailbroken with Dopamine:** turn on JIT for apps in the jailbreak's settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• **iOS 27 或更高版本**：设置 › JIT › 在此 iPhone 上配对。无需电脑。\n• **iOS 26**：内置 StikJIT，加上在电脑上生成的配对文件和 LocalDevVPN。\n• **更早的 iOS，或在 LiveContainer 中运行的 Husk**：StikDebug App。\n• **通过 TrollStore 安装**：TrollStore，并打开其“URL Scheme”设置。\n• **使用 Dopamine 越狱**：在越狱设置中为 App 开启 JIT。"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version" : "1.0"
